<title>INDIA: India's RBI rejects sole bid at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI rejects sole bid at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it received only one bid for 20 billion rupes at a repos auction held on Monday.</p>
<p>RBI said it rejected the bid.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)22-265 9000</p>
